										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791476058809_562545439722835111_572679173080014456", {"feature":"562545439722835111","feature2":"572679173080014456","owner":"103582791476058809","commentthreadid":"661792629","total_count":5,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":790582901,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":5352720,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"572679173080027684":{"text":"No way to find out right now. Discord got raided by another indie dev spamming slurs and regular anti-ai psychosis, so it's under quarantine now.","author":"Naughty Pig"},"572679490124152898":{"text":"[quote=Naughty Pig;572679173080027684]No way to find out right now. Discord got raided by another indie dev spamming slurs and regular anti-ai psychosis, so it's under quarantine now. [\/quote]\n\nof course you'd be someone in the server \ud83d\ude2d\ud83d\ude2d \n\nSo you know exactly who I am and what I have access too. \n\nthe person spamming slurs wasn't an indie dev, it was some kid you buffoon\n\nWhat a chud","author":"Rick Deckard"},"572679490124152955":{"text":"[quote=bread_dude]I just want to know how much of the game is ai or even if there is any also whens the next update. [\/quote]\n\n\nthe ENTIRE game is AI generated, if you need proof add me and i'll show you. \n\nThere is little to no human input in this project in any degree, shape or form.\n\n\nit is also just very bad.","author":"Rick Deckard"},"572679490124153918":{"text":"Oh its pretty good for being fully vibecoded.","author":"bread_dude"},"572679490124172622":{"text":"[quote=Rick Deckard;572679490124152898][quote=Naughty Pig;572679173080027684]No way to find out right now. Discord got raided by another indie dev spamming slurs and regular anti-ai psychosis, so it's under quarantine now. [\/quote]\n\nof course you'd be someone in the server \ud83d\ude2d\ud83d\ude2d \n\nSo you know exactly who I am and what I have access too. \n\nthe person spamming slurs wasn't an indie dev, it was some kid you buffoon\n\nWhat a chud [\/quote]\nDare I join a game server to check on updates so some immature forum \"AI specialist\" can't make ad-hominem.\n\nYes I know who you are, a meat bag on two legs like I said in another comment.\n\nThe person spamming slurs did also promote another indie game while doing so. And in the end it doesn't if it was dev himself.\n\nYou are yet again using some moralist argument \"oh but no human input\", who cares if in the end the product works? Prompting is human input objectively. It is a moral argument to say the dev must do something beyond that. That by side, you still didn't provide a single evidence to your claims apart from visual observation and something like \"but it's obvious.\"\n\nVibe coding multiplayer could pose a real issue and a threat to players if security is on a low level.\n\nThe game appeared on Steam just a few days ago. Back in the day people used a lot of store assets and replaced them with time. Today people use AI assets. No difference. Expecting a game to be full of own assets from the start is very unrealistic for early access.","author":"Naughty Pig"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
